{
 "schema": "bie.toolbox.capabilities/1",
 "version": "2026-10-26.1",
 "note": "Task 046a: the fixed vocabulary of what BIE may need to show. A scene plan names a capability; the resolver (bie/toolbox/resolver.py) picks the tools that compute and draw it. content_types are the ids of bie/brain/rulebook/content_types.json; verbs are the words of a Task 045d unpack's visual_verb that point to the capability; benchmark_block names the block of bie/brain/rulebook/benchmarks/epithelium_animation.json it serves. Task 046: default_level is the visual level (bie/brain/rulebook/visual_levels.json) a shot of this capability is made at unless the content asks for another; blocks are the code blocks (bie/brain/video/blocks/, Task 046 benchmark and new sets) that draw it, best first.",
